WEBVTT

00:04:58.596 --> 00:05:02.796
to answer the question of which areas
in the ocean we must protect first.

00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:06.516
And how much of the ocean
do we need to protect?

00:05:07.036 --> 00:05:09.076
We decided to focus on three objectives:

00:05:09.636 --> 00:05:12.236
biodiversity,

00:05:12.276 --> 00:05:13.956
food

00:05:14.996 --> 00:05:18.116
and carbon storage to help
mitigate climate change.

00:05:20.076 --> 00:05:22.356
If we think of each
objective in isolation,

00:05:22.356 --> 00:05:24.236
there are tradeoffs.

00:05:24.236 --> 00:05:26.516
Protecting the top areas for biodiversity

00:05:26.556 --> 00:05:29.236
could result in a loss
of fishing catch, for example.

00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:31.596
To solve that problem,